                    img.img-fluid(src="../assets/images/layout-3/services/4.png", alt="services-4")
                a(href="#!")
                  h4 Non Surgical
                p Botox is a well-known injectable treatment that temporarily reduces the appearance of dynamic wrinkles, such as frown lines, crow’s feet, and forehead lines. It works by relaxing the muscles responsible for these wrinkles.
                a.btn.btn-md.sub-btn(href="sortable-2.html") View More
          .col-lg-4.col-sm-6 
            .surgery-content
              .services-bg
                .services-img
                  .cosmetic-services
                    img.img-fluid(src="../assets/images/layout-3/services/5.png", alt="services-5")
                a(href="#!")
                  h4 Brain Surgery
                p A craniotomy involves removing a portion of the skull to access the brain. This procedure is commonly used to remove brain tumors, treat aneurysms, or address traumatic brain injuries.
